    // Sticky-park RESET probe v3 (dmtools-agents#681, live fa#1213
    // 2026-10-03 22:56–23:10): the LAST SUBSTANTIVE commit of the head,
    // not the head itself. Live race: the human pushed retrigger 7ecf11d7
